| 63-56 | Rsvd | **Reserved** |
| 55-48 | Rsvd | **Reserved** |
| 47-40 | Rsvd | **Reserved** |
| 39-32 | Rsvd | **Reserved** |
| 31-24 | Rsvd | **Reserved** |
| 23-16 | HwInit | **Maximum Current for 1.8V** |
| 15-08 | HwInit | **Maximum Current for 3.0V** |
| 07-00 | HwInit | **Maximum Current for 3.3V** |

@enduml

